# Root gerçek fareyle hakkı verir, ek grubu alır ve hakkı geri alır.
# Bu üç kararı veren semantic commission komutu bu rotada yoktur.
new
lang ru
act recruit
panel council
expect Troops 1400
expect Gold 720
expect Food 340
expect DumasLoyalty 60
expect DumasOfficerCommission False
wait 0.8
state 00-before-right
shot 00-start
wait 55
expect DumasOfficerCommission True
expect DumasExtraRecruitUsed False
expect Troops 1400
expect Gold 720
expect Food 340
expect DumasLoyalty 60
expect CommissionRevokeGold 117
state 01-native-granted
shot 01-native-granted
wait 55
expect DumasOfficerCommission True
expect DumasExtraRecruitUsed True
expect Troops 1600
expect Manpower 2000
expect Gold 600
expect Food 320
expect MilitarySupplies 90
expect DumasLoyalty 61
expect CommissionRevokeGold 134
state 02-native-extra
shot 02-native-extra
wait 55
expect DumasOfficerCommission False
expect DumasExtraRecruitUsed True
expect Troops 1600
expect Manpower 2000
expect Gold 466
expect Food 320
expect MilitarySupplies 90
expect DumasLoyalty 61
state 03-native-revoked
shot 03-native-revoked
save
remember native-right-revoked
load
same native-right-revoked
state 04-native-revoked-loaded
# Girdi incelemesinden sonra aynı public hedef emriyle eski iki haftalık devam.
establishment budget 1400
expect ArmyReductionDueWeek 2
week
expect Troops 1600
expect DumasExtraRecruitUsed False
week
expect Week 2
expect PendingPetition True
expect Troops 1400
expect Manpower 2200
expect ArmyReductionDueWeek 0
expect ArmyCost 153
expect ArmyConsumption 47
state 05-first-reduction
shot 04-first-reduction
quit
